===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The act of [[ignite|igniting]].
# The [[initiation]] of [[combustion]].
# A [[system]] for [[activate|activating]] [[combustion]] in a combustion [[engine]].
# Receptacle for a key used to start the engine in a vehicle.

